          "settings": {
            "quote": "As a pilates instructor, I'm on my feet teaching back-to-back classes all day. SÉANCE matcha gives me sustained energy without the crash I used to get from coffee. I love that it's clean, natural, and actually supports my metabolism. My clients always ask what my secret is—it's this matcha! The taste is smooth, vibrant, and honestly just makes me feel good. I'm obsessed.",
